{"code":"060540","name":"에스에이티","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"핸드셋","sector_desc":"휴대폰 부품·완제품. 주요 고객사의 신제품 출시 사이클을 따라 움직입니다.","desc":"동사는 1998년 전자제어기기의 설계·개발 및 제조 사업을 목적으로 설립되었고, 2006년 코스닥에 상장됨. 국내외 14개 종속회사를 보유하고 있으며, 베트남 소재 나노테크, 나노비전 등 해외 계열사를 통해 글로벌 사업을 전개하고 있음. 주요 사업은 ITS, 모바일 부품 공급 및 부동산 임대업이며, 종속회사로 교정사업, 건설폐기물 처리업, 수축필름 제조 등을 운영하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-30","n_days":300,"close":1194.0,"open":1175.0,"high":1194.0,"low":1131.0,"volume":14459,"amount":17264046.0,"ret_1d":1.7036,"gap":0.0852,"range_pct":5.2764,"ret_5":-0.5,"ret_20":-10.158,"ret_60":11.0698,"ret_120":-13.4783,"ret_250":-4.7087,"ma20":1261.25,"ma60":1279.0,"ma120":1247.575,"ma200":1282.525,"close_vs_ma200":-6.9024,"close_vs_ma60":-6.6458,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":47.3347,"r2_60":0.1057,"slope_120":3.08,"r2_120":0.0016,"slope_250":-6.6926,"r2_250":0.0557,"high52":1618.0,"low52":989.0,"pos_52w":32.5914,"dd_52w":-26.2052,"mdd_1y":-31.4111,"atr14_pct":6.5686,"vol_ann_60":37.8626,"vol_avg20":16440.3,"vol_ratio20":0.8795,"vr5":0.2909,"vr20":0.213,"amount_avg5":17779079.8,"amount_avg20":20858245.95,"amount_avg60":61586454.2333,"obv_chg20":4.5392,"turnover_20":1.2582,"pv_eff_20":-8.0734,"rsi14":40.3548,"frgn_net_5":-10623.0,"inst_net_5":-1313.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0406,"inst_net_5_pct":-0.005,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0457,"frgn_net_20":6476.0,"inst_net_20":-2089.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0248,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.008,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0168,"frgn_net_60":42500.0,"inst_net_60":-1313.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.1626,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.005,"smart_net_60_pct":0.1576,"frgn_net_120":-95602.0,"inst_net_120":-1313.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.3658,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.005,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.3709,"foreign_ratio":1.4,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.15,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":20.0,"op_margin_q":4.1152,"op_qoq":66.6667,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":1100.0,"rev_yoy":38.0682,"op_trend_4q":-7.8049,"fin_period":"202606","roe":8.46,"debt_ratio":65.2,"per":3.63,"pbr":0.29,"div_yield":4.19,"foreign_rate":1